<ApplicationLayout
  title="Alfa Laval WHPX 405 Self-Cleaning Diesel Fuel Centrifuge"
  description="Alfa Laval WHPX 405 partial-discharge disc centrifuge: 3,700 L/h diesel at 40 C and 13 cSt, separate HFO capacities by viscosity and temperature, 5 HP."
