>

  <div class="bg-navy/5 border-l-4 border-gold/40 rounded-r-lg p-4 mb-6 not-prose">
    <p class="text-sm text-text-light leading-relaxed italic">Dolphin Centrifuge supplies parts, repairs, and remanufactured Alfa Laval WHPX 405 partial-discharge disc stack centrifuges. The OEM table lists 3,700 L/h (16.29 US GPM derived) for marine diesel and 1,700 L/h (7.48 US GPM derived) for 180 cSt HFO under their respective conditions. The separate 5,500 L/h (24.22 US GPM derived) rated-reference value has no source fluid specified and is not an application capacity.</p>
  </div>

  <h2 id="overview">WHPX 405 Partial-Discharge Centrifuge</h2>

  <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-6 items-start mb-6">
    <div class="flex-1">
      <p>
        The Alfa Laval WHPX 405 is a partial-ejection <a href="/disc-stack-centrifuge/">disc stack centrifuge</a> designed to remove water and solid particles from light oil and light fuel. The partial-discharge mechanism allows the centrifuge to purge only accumulated sludge while retaining process fluid in the bowl, minimizing product losses during each discharge cycle.
      </p>
      <p>
        With an operating speed of 7,600 RPM generating over 7,200 G-force, the WHPX 405 achieves exceptional separation efficiency on light oils and fuels. <a href="/pyrolysis-oil-centrifuge/">Pyrolysis oil</a> and <a href="/waste-oil-centrifuge/">waste oil separation</a> are particularly well-suited applications for this centrifuge.
      </p>
    </div>
    <figure class="m-0 shrink-0 md:max-w-[280px]">
      <img
        src="/images/alfa-laval-whpx-405/Alfa-Laval-WHPX405-Centrifuge-300-e1615139982322.webp"
        alt="Alfa Laval WHPX405 partial-discharge disc stack centrifuge"
        width="300"
        height="300"
        loading="lazy"
        class="rounded-lg img-cap-300"
      />
      <figcaption class="text-sm text-center text-text-light mt-1">Alfa Laval WHPX405 Centrifuge</figcaption>
    </figure>
  </div>

  <p>
    Dolphin Centrifuge is the independent specialist in <a href="/alfa-laval-centrifuges/">Alfa Laval</a> centrifuges. Apart from Alfa Laval itself, Dolphin is the reliable source for quality Alfa Laval machines: remanufactured centrifuges, turnkey systems, parts, and service, built on 40+ years of Alfa Laval experience and led by Sanjay Prabhu, M.S.M.E. Every WHPX 405 and MOPX 205 on this page is a genuine Alfa Laval separator, stripped, rebuilt, balanced, and tested in Dolphin's Warren, Michigan shop, then supplied on its own or inside the <a href="/dmpx-014-self-cleaning-3-phase-disc-stack-centrifuge/">Dolphin DMPX-014</a> module. Dolphin is an independent remanufacturer and is not affiliated with Alfa Laval.
  </p>

  <p>
    The WHPX 405 is available in ATEX Zone 2 hazardous area configurations, making it suitable for installations in refineries, offshore platforms, and other environments where flammable vapors may be present.
  </p>

  <h2 id="specifications">WHPX 405 Specifications</h2>

  <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-6 items-start mb-6">
    <div class="flex-1">
      <table>
        <tbody>
          <tr><td><strong>Model Type</strong></td><td>Alfa Laval WHPX 405 TGD 24-60</td></tr>
          <tr><td><strong>Rated Reference</strong></td><td>5,500 L/h (24.22 US GPM derived), source fluid unspecified; not an application capacity</td></tr>
          <tr><td><strong>Marine Diesel</strong></td><td>3,700 L/h (16.29 US GPM derived), 40 &deg;C, 13 cSt</td></tr>
          <tr><td><strong>HFO 30 / 40 cSt at 50 &deg;C</strong></td><td>3,400 L/h (14.97 US GPM derived), centrifuged at 70&ndash;98 / 80&ndash;98 &deg;C</td></tr>
          <tr><td><strong>HFO 60 cSt at 50 &deg;C</strong></td><td>2,600 L/h (11.45 US GPM derived), centrifuged at 80&ndash;98 &deg;C</td></tr>
          <tr><td><strong>HFO 100 cSt at 50 &deg;C</strong></td><td>2,500 L/h (11.01 US GPM derived), centrifuged at 90&ndash;98 &deg;C</td></tr>
          <tr><td><strong>HFO 180 cSt at 50 &deg;C</strong></td><td>1,700 L/h (7.48 US GPM derived), centrifuged at 90&ndash;98 &deg;C</td></tr>
          <tr><td><strong>HFO 380 cSt at 50 &deg;C</strong></td><td>1,400 L/h (6.16 US GPM derived), centrifuged at 98 &deg;C</td></tr>
          <tr><td><strong>Cross-Head R&amp;O Lube Oil</strong></td><td>1,700&ndash;1,900 L/h (7.48&ndash;8.37 US GPM derived), 80&ndash;90 &deg;C</td></tr>
          <tr><td><strong>Cross-Head Detergent Lube Oil</strong></td><td>1,400&ndash;1,700 L/h (6.16&ndash;7.48 US GPM derived), 80&ndash;90 &deg;C</td></tr>
          <tr><td><strong>Trunk Detergent Lube Oil</strong></td><td>1,000&ndash;1,200 L/h (4.40&ndash;5.28 US GPM derived), 80&ndash;90 &deg;C</td></tr>
          <tr><td><strong>Steam Turbine Lube Oil</strong></td><td>3,600 L/h (15.85 US GPM derived), 60&ndash;70 &deg;C</td></tr>
          <tr><td><strong>Sludge Space</strong></td><td>0.36 Gallons</td></tr>
          <tr><td><strong>Motor HP</strong></td><td>5 HP</td></tr>
          <tr><td><strong>Voltages</strong></td><td>230 / 460 V</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
    <figure class="m-0 shrink-0 md:max-w-[280px]">
      <img
        src="/images/alfa-laval-whpx-405/Alfa-Laval-WHPX405-ATEX-Hazardous-Area-System-300.webp"
        alt="Alfa Laval WHPX405 ATEX hazardous area centrifuge system"
        width="300"
        height="300"
        loading="lazy"
        class="rounded-lg img-cap-300"
      />
      <figcaption class="text-sm text-center text-text-light mt-1">Alfa Laval WHPX405 ATEX Hazardous Area System</figcaption>
    </figure>
  </div>

  <p class="text-sm">
    Capacities retain the source L/h values; US GPM is derived using L/h &divide; 227.124707 and shown to two decimal places. See the <a href="/technical-data/">authoritative technical-data methodology and machine-readable records</a>.
  </p>

  <div class="bg-gold/10 border-l-4 border-gold rounded-r-xl p-5 my-8 not-prose">
    <p class="text-base font-semibold text-navy mb-1">Need parts, repairs, or a remanufactured WHPX 405?</p>
    <p class="text-sm text-text-light mb-3">Dolphin Centrifuge supplies complete modules with pre-heaters, starters, and PLC control panels - available as the DMPX-014 turnkey system or as individual centrifuge rebuild services.</p>
    <a href="/contact-for-alfa-laval-centrifuges/" class="inline-block bg-gold hover:bg-gold/80 text-navy font-bold px-6 py-2 rounded-lg transition-colors text-sm">Request a Quote &rarr;</a>
  </div>

  <h2 id="mopx-205">Also Available: MOPX 205 Total-Discharge</h2>

  <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-6 items-start mb-6">
    <figure class="m-0 shrink-0 md:max-w-[280px]">
      <img
        src="/images/alfa-laval-whpx-405/Alfa-Laval-MOPX205-Diesel-Purifier.webp"
