      />
      <figcaption class="text-sm text-center text-text-light mt-1">Alfa Laval MOPX205 Diesel Centrifuge Installation</figcaption>
    </figure>
    <div class="flex-1">
      <p>
        The Alfa Laval MOPX 205 is a separate total-discharge base machine in the same commercial size class, designed for three-phase separation of mineral oils and fuels. Its OEM table lists distinct gas-oil, diesel, engine-lube-oil, and steam-turbine-oil records. Transformer oil, <a href="/quench-oil-centrifuge/">quench oil</a>, <a href="/black-diesel-centrifuge/">black diesel</a>, and other duties require application-specific sizing.
      </p>
      <table>
        <tbody>
          <tr><td><strong>Model Type</strong></td><td>Alfa Laval MOPX 205 TGT 20-60</td></tr>
          <tr><td><strong>Gas Oil</strong></td><td>4,900 L/h (21.57 US GPM derived), 40 &deg;C</td></tr>
          <tr><td><strong>Diesel</strong></td><td>3,300 L/h (14.53 US GPM derived), 40 &deg;C, 13 cSt at 40 &deg;C</td></tr>
          <tr><td><strong>R&amp;O / Engine Lube Oil</strong></td><td>1,700 L/h (7.48 US GPM derived), 80&ndash;90 &deg;C</td></tr>
          <tr><td><strong>Steam Turbine Lube Oil</strong></td><td>3,200 L/h (14.09 US GPM derived), 60&ndash;70 &deg;C</td></tr>
          <tr><td><strong>Sludge Space</strong></td><td>0.38 Gallons</td></tr>
          <tr><td><strong>Motor HP</strong></td><td>4 HP</td></tr>
          <tr><td><strong>Voltages</strong></td><td>230 / 460 V</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-6 items-start mb-6">
    <div class="flex-1">
      <h3>MOPX 205 for Pyrolysis Oil and Explosion-Proof Installations</h3>
      <p>
        Dolphin Centrifuge supplies the MOPX 205 in explosion-proof configurations for <a href="/explosion-proof-centrifuge/">hazardous area installations</a>. The MOPX 205 is particularly effective for <a href="/pyrolysis-oil-centrifuge/">tire oil and pyrolysis oil</a> dewatering, where its total-discharge design handles heavy sludge loads efficiently.
      </p>
    </div>
    <figure class="m-0 shrink-0 md:max-w-[280px]">
      <img
        src="/images/alfa-laval-whpx-405/Alfa-Laval-MOPX205-Tire-Oil-Pyrolysis-Centrifuge-e1614259359680.webp"
